<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Fire Mage DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 3 Pre-Raid. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, professions, boe gear and reputation rewards.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c8">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Fire Mage DPS in Phase 3</span></h2>There's some changes to how stats work in cataclysm and a new stat as well, because of this your priorities change a bit as well, but because of reforging it makes it easier to pick and choose how much of each stat you want. You'll want to use a mix of <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a> for red socket and items with bad socket bonuses, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52239/potent-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Potent Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Potent Ember Topaz</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52208/reckless-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Reckless Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ember Topaz</span></a> for yellow sockets, and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52217/veiled-demonseye">
<img alt="Veiled Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Demonseye</span></a> on blue sockets to help reach hit cap.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Once you've reached the Hit cap of 17%</ins>, you can start looking at critical strike, mastery and haste. <b>Critical Strike</b> Rating remains unchanged and simply increases the chances to hit for <ins>150% damage</ins> (withholding modifiers). <b>Haste</b> on the other hand now also increases the <ins>tick rate of damage over time spells</ins> on top of decreasing cast time of regular spells. While mastery increases the damage of ticks throughout damage over time spells such as <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83853/combustion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combustion</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=12846/ignite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_incinerate.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ignite</span></a> and others.<br/>
<br/>Out of these three, you'll <ins>first focus on Haste</ins> to reach specific haste soft caps which <ins>enable a certain extra amount of ticks</ins> on the following damage over time spells:<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">5% for one extra tick of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83853/combustion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combustion</span></a>;</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">12.5% for one extra tick of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=11366/pyroblast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_fireball02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyroblast</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=44457/living-bomb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_livingbomb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Living Bomb</span></a>;</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">15% for two extra ticks of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83853/combustion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combustion</span></a>;</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">25% for three extra ticks of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=83853/combustion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Combustion</span></a>;</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">37.5% for two extra ticks of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=11366/pyroblast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_fireball02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyroblast</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=44457/living-bomb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_livingbomb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Living Bomb</span></a>.</div></li></ul>These percentages are not the total you'll want to reach with gear, but instead with gear combined with raid buffs, talents, racials and so on.<br/>To do this easily, you can follow the instructions in the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/mage/fire/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve#gearing-advice">Stat Priority Gearing Advice</a> section.<br/>
<br/>
