<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Fire Mage Phase 3</h3>Make sure to buy the tier 12 pieces first, followed by the wand and then whichever of the last three items is the biggest upgrade for you depending on what you currently have.<br/>
<br/>Although <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71286/firehawk-gloves">
<img alt="Firehawk Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firehawk Gloves</span></a> can be a solid upgrade, they'll eventually be replaced by the off-piece gloves and you'll ideally be using four-piece tier 12 through with head/<wbr/>shoulders/<wbr/>chest/<wbr/>legs instead.<br/>This means that if you have really bad gloves, feel free to use them as a temporary upgrade - but if you have access to tier head and shoulders then don't hesitate to skip buying the gloves entirely and pickup the wand as your third valor item instead<div class="pad"></div>
