<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to the head slot, we can now get tier 11 shoulders from the new Heroic Dungeon difficulty which allows us access to some early set bonuses that provide great value. These are the highest item level at 359 before raid in this slot which would make them pre-raid best even without the set bonus, making them the easy choice.<br/>
<br/>Everything else is barely even worth considering outside of just filling the slot temporarily while farming the best item here.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
