<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back">Back for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to the headpiece slot, we can also buy the phase 1 and 2 best in slot cloak that used to be exclusive to <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=45213/sinestra">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sinestra</span></a>, it's now available from the new heroic inferno protocol dungeons via the new fissure stone fragment currency. This cloak is miles better than anything else we can get outside of raid and is only replaced by the heroic <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=52409/ragnaros">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ragnaros</span></a> cloak.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
