<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest">Chest for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>With the addition of the new tier 12 set, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71289/firehawk-robes">
<img alt="Firehawk Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firehawk Robes</span></a> is now available from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> currency and it is the new pre-raid best in slot. The past tier 11 chest becomes available from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> vendor instead, and is still worth getting early on if you have enough currency from doing dungeons while leveling up. Every other option isn't worth considering anymore.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
