<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Althought not as high priority as tier 12 items, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71213/amulet-of-burning-brilliance">
<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a> <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is a great purchase to get caught up with other players.<br/>Because the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70106/nightweavers-amulet">
<img alt="Nightweaver's Amulet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_neck_hyjaldaily_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightweaver's Amulet</span></a> is now obtainable without RNG and without assistance from others, it invalidates most if not all past options that I'd consider worthwhile.<br/>
<br/>The reputation neck is still listed as it's worthwhile getting if you're doing dungeons for valor anyways early on, only until you unlock the formerly mentioned item.<div class="pad"></div>
