<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> is by far the best pre-raid trinket you can obtain, if you have any budget put aside for pre-raid gearing, use it for this since it's still best in slot in phase 3.<br/>Alongside it, I recommend getting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65053/bell-of-enraging-resonance">
<img alt="Bell of Enraging Resonance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bell_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bell of Enraging Resonance</span></a> from the new heroic inferno protocol dungeon currency since it's the heroic version of the trinket that's available at the vendor.<div class="pad"></div>
