<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-and-two-handed-weapons-for-fire-mage-dps-phase-3-pre-raid">Main-Hand and Two-Handed Weapons for Fire Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>The crafted bind on equip <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70156/masterwork-elementium-spellblade">
