<img alt="Trail of Embers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_wand_1h_firelandsraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trail of Embers</span></a> is the new pre-raid wand, as well as (after upgrading) the phase 3 best in slot wand, this means that most wands below it are barely worth looking at since you'll want to get this regardless of your situation.<br/>
<br/>The two other wands are okay, they can fill the slot temporarily until you have the required <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
